{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>對於持有信用卡且希望規劃債務清償的用戶而言，這款應用是不可或缺的工具。它提供清晰的數據輔助，幫助使用者掌握還款成本與時間。目前該應用正進行限時免費活動，原價為 US $0.99，建議有財務規劃需求的用戶把握機會下載體驗。</p>\n\n<h2>整合四種實用計算模式</h2>\n<p>此應用內建四種專用計算器：一是根據固定月繳金額估算結清餘額所需時間與總成本；二是設定目標還款期限以反推每月應繳金額；三是計算最低還款額度；四是評估保留餘額一個月的利息支出。介面直覺且無需網路連線即可運作，無訂閱費或廣告干擾，讓用戶能安心管理個人信用財務。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-58-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-59-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-60-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-61-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-62-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-63-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Credit Card Calculator</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-09T00:37:58.259558+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}